#: ../../guide/proselint-setup.md:1
msgid "Proselint Setup"
msgstr "Proselint Setup"

#: ../../guide/proselint-setup.md:3
msgid "[Proselint](https://github.com/amperser/proselint) is a linter for English prose that checks for common style and usage errors. Language Check integrates Proselint as an optional engine alongside Harper, LanguageTool, and Vale."
msgstr "[Proselint](https://github.com/amperser/proselint) is a linter for English prose that checks for common style and usage errors. Language Check integrates Proselint as an optional engine alongside Harper, LanguageTool, and Vale."

#: ../../guide/proselint-setup.md:8
msgid "Proselint only supports **English**. It is automatically skipped when `spell_language` is set to a non-English locale."
msgstr "Proselint only supports **English**. It is automatically skipped when `spell_language` is set to a non-English locale."

#: ../../guide/proselint-setup.md:12
msgid "Installing Proselint"
msgstr "Installing Proselint"

#: ../../guide/proselint-setup.md:14
msgid "Proselint is a Python package. Install it so the `proselint` binary is on your `$PATH`."
msgstr "Proselint is a Python package. Install it so the `proselint` binary is on your `$PATH`."

